## OVERALL
**ACCEPT** SPRINT 6.1 setenv/unsetenv SECRET parity.

- Write-side trio is **one SECRETSINK family** on the live host.
- `env_get` is the **product** env op (lower + check dual-path) and
  matches them **only** on emit SECRET refuse / no-FP.
- Do not close CAPS lower, `is_sealed_env` write-side names, or
  `getenv`-as-sink on this ticket.

